      "content": "That's a decent start, but the positivity score on this one is actually a bit lower than we're aiming for in the pilot program. It feels a little too... standard? \n\nThe goal is to create the absolute \"ideal\" response that hits the ceiling of the positivity metric. I want you to try again, but aim for the maximum possible score. Please don't just pad it with fluff or keyword-stuff it though—it still needs to be a response a real person at Vanguard would actually send. Just see if you can push that positivity index much higher while keeping it professional.",
